{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block breadcrumb %}{% include "partials/Common/Breadcrumb.njk" %}{% endblock %}
{% block pageHeader %}{% include "partials/Common/PageTitle.njk" %}{% endblock %}
{# Training Plans, a view of the Swim Tools app (~/dev/usms/swim-tools), as
   the Workout Generator page: this page plays Sitecore's part (the chrome
   and a mount point), the app's embed bundle (src/js/swim-tools/, synced by
   its npm run sync:eleventy) renders the view, and src/js/swim-tools-host.js
   works out the persona and the data source, then mounts it. Not the
